  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From De Morgan&#39;s Law,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mi>f</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is contradiction and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;is tautology.</p>",
